WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:08,470
Do you want to be my friend?

2
00:00:08,470 --> 00:00:09,790
you what did you say

3
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:16,040
Let’s be friends, Brother Yingdi Gu

4
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:19,080
Do you want to kill Gu Shiyi too?

5
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:21,220
I'm just here to watch the fun

6
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:23,860
If you continue to watch this excitement like this

7
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,620
I'm afraid it might turn out to be a fake.

8
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:28,690
No one cares whether the rumors in the world are true or false.

9
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:30,210
As long as someone spreads it

10
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:31,850
It must not be clean

11
00:00:32,290 --> 00:00:33,470
Are you right, Brother Gu?

12
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:34,670
It can't be true

13
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:36,430
Of course it’s fake and it’s really impossible

14
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:38,590
Just think you are real

15
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:40,350
What about your friends?

16
00:00:40,630 --> 00:00:43,780
Could it be that they are all just here to watch the show? Of course not

17
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:48,940
Are you going to kill Gu Shiyi with your own hands?

18
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:54,320
Will you come little bug?
